+/*
+ * Spinning 3D coffee box with a live, interactive HTML form on its front face.
+ *
+ * Native path (HTML-in-Canvas, `<canvas layoutsubtree>`):
+ *   The form is a real child of the canvas. On every `paint` event the browser
